{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":[["^Um...","\n","^H-hello?","\n","^You work here, right?","\n","^I think you do.","\n","^I mean, you're standing there like you do.","\n","^So.","\n","^I was wondering if I could come in for a minute.","\n","^Just a minute.","\n","^Something feels off behind me.","\n","^But it might just be the wind.","\n","ev","str","^What do you mean “off”?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^What did you see?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"explain_fear"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"explain_fear"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"explain_fear":[["^R-right.","\n","^Okay.","\n","^So when I was walking, I heard footsteps.","\n","^But they weren't like my footsteps.","\n","^Mine sound lighter.","\n","^I think.","\n","^Unless I'm heavier than I think I am.","\n","^That's possible too.","\n","^Anyway, when I stopped walking, the footsteps stopped.","\n","^Which is normal.","\n","^Unless someone else stopped at the same time.","\n","^That happens in movies.","\n","ev","str","^Movies aren’t real. Did you see anyone?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You’re shaking. Take a breath.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"saw_anyone"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_scared"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"player_scared","re":true},{"->":"calm_response"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"doubt_response":[["^Y-yeah.","\n","^That's what my mom used to say.","\n","^That I think too much.","\n","^Or not enough.","\n","^I never figured out which one she meant.","\n","^I'm probably just tired.","\n","^But being tired makes it easier for bad things to happen, I think.","\n","^Or maybe that's naps.","\n","^I get those mixed up.","\n","ev","str","^Focus. Did you actually see someone?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Go home. You’re fine.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"saw_anyone"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_mean"},2,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"player_mean","re":true},{"->":"send_away"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"calm_response":[["^Oh.","\n","^Okay.","\n","^Breathing.","\n","^In.","\n","^Out.","\n","^I think I'm doing it wrong.","\n","^But I feel a little better.","\n","^Still don't like the dark though.","\n","^The dark feels like it's leaning.","\n","^Does it look like it's leaning to you?","\n","ev","str","^No. Tell me what you saw.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You’re imagining things.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"saw_anyone"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"doubt_response"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"saw_anyone":[["^S-see them?","\n","^Not clearly.","\n","^There was a shape.","\n","^Or maybe a space where a shape should've been.","\n","^It was near the trees.","\n","^But trees are very suspicious at night.","\n","^They move even when they shouldn't.","\n","^This one felt like it noticed me noticing it.","\n","^Which sounds silly.","\n","^I know that.","\n","ev","str","^Describe the shape.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You’re just scared.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"describe_shape"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_scared"},1,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"player_scared","re":true},{"->":"maybe_response"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"maybe_response":[["^Oh...","\n","^M-maybe you're right.","\n","^I'd feel a lot better if I come come inside for a moment...","\n","ev","str","^You can come inside. Quickly.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You should leave right now.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"let_inside"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"send_away"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"describe_shape":[["^Um.","\n","^It was tall.","\n","^Or average.","\n","^Taller than me.","\n","^That part I’m sure about.","\n","^It didn't move much.","\n","^Which was the worst part.","\n","^If it moved, I'd know it was real.","\n","^I think it had something dark on.","\n","^Like a coat.","\n","^Or a shadow pretending to be a coat.","\n","ev","str","^You can come inside. Quickly.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^You should leave right now.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"let_inside"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"send_away"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"let_inside":["^R-really?","\n","^Thank you.","\n","^I promise I won't touch anything.","\n","^Or look at anything too long.","\n","^I'll just stay near the light.","\n","^Lights make things honest.","\n","^At least I think they do.","\n","ev","str","^allowed_inside","/str",true,{"x()":"SetEventVar","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"send_away":["^Oh.","\n","^Okay.","\n","^That's fair.","\n","^You're probably right.","\n","^I'm sorry for bothering you.","\n","^I'll just walk fast.","\n","^Fast walking makes you harder to catch.","\n","^I heard that somewhere.","\n","^If I start running, don't worry.","\n","^That's normal for me.","\n","ev","str","^allowed_inside","/str",false,{"x()":"SetEventVar","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"player_mean"},0,{"VAR=":"player_scared"},0,{"VAR=":"player_stupid"},0,{"VAR=":"SpiritAngered"},0,{"VAR=":"GraveRobberSetup"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}